      <rules>
        <rule id="2add-e120-0111-7008" name="Development and composition checks" hidden="false">
          <description>v0.5 alpha. New catalogue selection logic has static tests but has not yet been exercised in New Recruit. Percentage checks remain provisional: verify categories against the agreed battle limit and avoid double-counting nested champion points. Band division, Banshee allowances, profile conflicts and other exceptions are documented in COVERAGE.md.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="c3d6-8c27-efda-9741" name="Where to find special characters" hidden="false">
          <description>Azhag the Slaughterer — Characters; Gorfang Rotgut — Characters; Grom the Paunch with Niblit — Characters; Gorbad Ironclaw — Characters; Morglum Necksnapper — Characters; Oglok the ’Orrible — Characters; Skarsnik with Gobbla — Characters.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
