              <rules>
                <rule id="4101-371e-60a9-9543" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
                  <description>Two crew with hand weapons and light armour; two team animals.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="7c70-3ce0-8be9-82fb" name="Required mobs" hidden="false">
                  <description>Requires at least one of: Orc Boyz, Orc Arrer Boyz, Orc Big’uns, Orc Boar Boyz, Savage Orcs, Savage Orc Boar Boyz, Black Orcs.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="c1bb-5d51-c5d8-16b8" name="Character chariot" hidden="false">
                  <description>Chariot and crew are paid within Characters. Check combined chariot-band formation and standard allowances with any separately selected machines. The printed machine includes two crew; record the character on this chariot.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
