        <rule id="3ae6-72c6-5b88-fbe3" name="Models and command" hidden="false">
          <description>Select troopers plus any command; command replaces a trooper. A standard and musician cost twice an equipped trooper; champions use their own profile and price. Whole-unit options charge each affected model automatically. Independent Wight/Wraith champions buy their own equipment and mount.</description>
        </rule>
