        <rule id="b8f3-d528-9e6d-d681" name="Army-list note" hidden="false">
          <description>Standard and musician follow the general all-units permission in Orcs &amp; Goblins p. 82, at twice the trooper/base price. No invented champion profile is used. Apply the band-distribution rules manually.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0345-e998-6995-7e62" name="Models and command" hidden="false">
          <description>Select troopers plus any command; command replaces a trooper. A standard and musician cost twice an equipped trooper; champions use their own profile and price. Whole-unit options charge each affected model automatically. Independent Wight/Wraith champions buy their own equipment and mount.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
